## 📊 Gold-layer KPIs (what lands in BI)

- **`gold.region_activity_window`** — event count, avg/max/min magnitude,
  significant-event count (M ≥ 4.5), strongest event, tsunami-alert count,
  avg depth — per region, per run window.
- **`gold.global_summary_window`** — single-number headline tiles: total
  events, distinct regions active, avg/max magnitude, significant &
  tsunami-alert counts — per run window.
- **`gold.swarm_signals`** — flags each region `normal` / `elevated` /
  `swarm` by comparing this window's event count to that region's trailing
  7-day baseline for windows of the same length.
- **`gold.daily_region_summary`** — daily rollup by region/country, the
  table a Power BI trend dashboard points at for history.

